From f3aeb886bf57316d18381c464930d2fbf7c55927 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 21:13:31 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dnsmasq: "no router cache" keeps the minimum cache while
 DNSSEC validates

dnsmasq refuses to start with a cache below its default (150) while it
validates DNSSEC ("cannot reduce cache size from default when DNSSEC
enabled"), so cache-size=0 with dnssec on took the resolver down on the
owner's router (2026-09-06). reaper_dns_cachesize(): 1500 normally, 0 with
the switch on, 150 with the switch on while validating (proxy-dnssec under
DoT is not validation). The page shows RDHC_26 under the switch when DNSSEC
is on (25 packs).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 release/src/router/rc/services.c              | 23 ++++++++++++++++++-
 .../router/www/Advanced_System_Content.asp    |  4 ++++
 release/src/router/www/BR.dict                |  1 +
 release/src/router/www/CN.dict                |  1 +
 release/src/router/www/CZ.dict                |  1 +
 release/src/router/www/DA.dict                |  1 +
 release/src/router/www/DE.dict                |  1 +
 release/src/router/www/EN.dict                |  1 +
 release/src/router/www/ES.dict                |  1 +
 release/src/router/www/FI.dict                |  1 +
 release/src/router/www/FR.dict                |  1 +
 release/src/router/www/HU.dict                |  1 +
 release/src/router/www/IT.dict                |  1 +
 release/src/router/www/JP.dict                |  1 +
 release/src/router/www/KR.dict                |  1 +
 release/src/router/www/MS.dict                |  1 +
 release/src/router/www/NL.dict                |  1 +
 release/src/router/www/NO.dict                |  1 +
 release/src/router/www/PL.dict                |  1 +
 release/src/router/www/RO.dict                |  1 +
 release/src/router/www/RU.dict                |  1 +
 release/src/router/www/SL.dict                |  1 +
 release/src/router/www/SV.dict                |  1 +
 release/src/router/www/TH.dict                |  1 +
